From e826b7b01c2de88f1497d815381a43da9972f4c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 06:17:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v4: simplification D1-D7 (U051)

Four bottom tabs (Create, Discover, Progress, Me) replace the hamburger
below lg, and the desktop sidebar names the same four. Home signed in is
Create (Ask, next chapter, Recent, one community shelf); Explore is
Discover; My Wellness is Progress (Your goals / Data sources); your profile
is Me with Library, Credits & plan, notifications, invite, settings, help.
Sessions is Library (Created / Played, edit only your own); coins only in
Me and where earned; the Insights page redirects to Session details or
Analysis; others' player sheet is one Recreate; the chat's deck opens the
+ sheet as one list with one score per change. Notification date filters
gone, session settings is Edit session. All v4-only: v2 and v3 are
pixel-identical before and after (88 screens).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
